    "body": "These anonymous posts/comments can either be ignored while calculating the rewards or all rewards going to these comments/posts may added to the total pool. (I don't know if there will be any difference between the effects of these two implementations on the total rewards)\n\nI know there are methods to create anonymous accounts, but this feature might be necessary in future, when the social/political messages made are against powerful groups. Also it can bring in many advantages to Steemit which the anonymity provides to Reddit. ",
